<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2666" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">annĭversārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		annusverto, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that returns</i>, <i>happens</i>, <i>is used</i>, etc., <i>every year</i>,
				<i>returning</i> or <i>renewed
				annually</i>, <i>annual</i>, <i>yearly</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sacra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Verr. 2, 4, 39</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ecce solemnitas Domini est in Silo
					anniversaria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Jud. 21, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">festi dies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Verr. 2, 4, 48 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(caeli) vicissitudines,</span>”
				<i>the changes of the seasons of the year</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					N. D. 2, 38, 97</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 16, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 4,
					45</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hostes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					1, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">valetudines,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 81</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pervigilium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Galb. 4 al.</span></i>
			—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">annĭversārĭē</span></b> , <i>annually</i>, <i><span class="en">Aug. Ep.
				118 <i>fin.</i></span></i></div>
